{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A floating/dockable window for keeping a curated library of reference sounds inside Reaper, with instant preview through Monitor FX and Reference mode for comparing sounds with your project.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Windows only.} Requires the free {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sws-extension.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
SWS
}}}
 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/cfillion/reaimgui"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
ReaImGui
}}}
 extensions.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Support: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:yoni.ybtools@gmail.com"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
yoni.ybtools@gmail.com
}}}
\par}
}
